{"pull": {"id": "number:21736", "number": 21736, "title": "KAFKA-20132: Fix header-based key deserialization in MeteredTimestampedKeyValueStoreWithHeaders iterator methods", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-03-12T18:05:37Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-15T16:42:04Z", "merged_at": "2026-03-15T16:42:04Z", "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Fixes bugs where `MeteredTimestampedKeyValueStoreWithHeaders` iterator\nmethods fail when key deserializers require headers.\n\n The class inherits iterator-returning methods from\n`MeteredKeyValueStore`:    - `range(K, K)` / `reverseRange(K, K)`    -\n`all()` / `reverseAll()`    - `prefixScan(P, PS)`\n\n  These methods use `deserializeKey(rawKey)` which calls\n`serdes.keyFrom(rawKey, internalContext.headers())`, using the current\nprocessing context's headers instead of each record's own headers.\n\n  Additionally, the `peekNextKey()` implementation in iterator classes\ndeserializes keys with empty headers.\n\nReviewers: Matthias J. Sax <matthias@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 2129035451, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwyMTI5MDM1NDUx", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/kip", "name": "kip", "color": "a01d16", "default": false, "description": "Requires or implements a KIP", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21736"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_frankvicky_is_pr.json"}